flowchart LR
    A[Pick real problem] --> B[Define metric + success bar]
    B --> C[Get or build dataset]
    C --> D[EDA + data contract]
    D --> E[Baseline model]
    E --> F[Improved approach]
    F --> G[Honest evaluation + error analysis]
    G --> H[Demo or service]
    H --> I[Monitoring plan]
    I --> J[README + writeup + tradeoffs]
    J --> K[Portfolio artifact]
